  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management FAQs\n\n### How do I respond to Client Requests?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 11 Sep, 2019 at 11:03 AM\n\n\t\tLocation: Practice Management Module > Workspace > Client Requests\n\nRefer to the link\n\nYou can view and respond to tickets your clients send to you from the Client Requests section in Practice Management.\n\nOnce you are on the Client Requests page, click on the Ticket Title you wish to review.\n\nOn this page, scroll down to review the client request. You can also view and download any attachments.\n\nClick here to watch how to respond to client requests\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188583\">Practice Management FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How do I respond to Client Requests?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 11 Sep, 2019 at 11:03 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p>Location: Practice Management Module &gt; Workspace &gt; Client Requests</p><p><a href=\"https://appv4.capium.com/#/workspace/workspace-support-tickets\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a></p><p><br></p><p>You can view and respond to tickets your clients send to you from the Client Requests section in Practice Management.</p><p><br></p><p>Once you are on the Client Requests page, click on the Ticket Title you wish to review.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9085649088/original/3F-Ep-6HePYVZ8UsyM-RVNEIpdbheCw_bw.png?1568195553\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" style=\"width: 784px;\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9085649088/original/3F-Ep-6HePYVZ8UsyM-RVNEIpdbheCw_bw.png?1568195553\" data-fileid=\"9085649088\" data-uniquekey=\"1568195255606\"></p><p><br></p><p>On this page, scroll down to review the client request. You can also view and download any attachments.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9085649662/original/flXPHHROy8sEwLle1aGskexk981sDna8Xw.png?1568196026\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9085649662/original/flXPHHROy8sEwLle1aGskexk981sDna8Xw.png?1568196026\" data-fileid=\"9085649662\" data-uniquekey=\"1568195255606\" style=\"width: 788px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/d73d3bd5a6694746b36996a1b42ad3a2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to respond to client requests</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000174901\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000174901/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000174901\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000174901/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000174901\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-s